    {
      "text": "Article: property undeveloped, minor changes proposed to an existing approved plan, three phases. 170 studios, 597 one-bedrooms, 308 two-bedrooms.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-001503"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "City documents give the site as APNs 104-40-021 and 104-40-036 (13.3 acres bounded by Freedom Circle, Mission College Blvd, San Tomas Aquino Creek and Highway 101). The county dataset assigns the situs 3905 Freedom Circle to APN 104-40-037.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002029",
        "SRC-002035"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Dec. 2025 staff report: three residential buildings (A, B, C); 2.014-acre public park (87,728 sq ft) built and maintained by the developer, 1.922 acres of private recreation, and $21,455,673 in park in-lieu fees. Park Phase 1 opens with the first of Building B or C; Phase 2 when both are complete.",
      "src": [
        "SRC-002030"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "SF YIMBY (June 2022): three apartment buildings up to 100 feet tall; parking for 396 bicycles.",
